{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39836250",
      "title": "Repetition: Managing User Input with State (Two-Way-Binding)",
      "sourceHash": "2753438e1454e26fdb1f170ef0d447be96872f21a521a10e40ca6b0f1b2fbb4b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.54,
          "end": 1.56,
          "en": "So let's now make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.56,
          "end": 3.99,
          "en": "that this player component here works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 3.99,
          "end": 6.66,
          "en": "and that I can set my name here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.66,
          "end": 9.18,
          "en": "so that \"unknown entity\" gets replaced",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.18,
          "end": 11.163,
          "en": "with the value I entered here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.27,
          "end": 13.83,
          "en": "and let's start by adding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 13.83,
          "end": 16.53,
          "en": "this functionality without using refs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 16.53,
          "end": 20.58,
          "en": "so with only the features we already know, and here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.58,
          "end": 22.58,
          "en": "we could therefore, of course, useState.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.52,
          "end": 27.303,
          "en": "That's how we solved similar problems before in this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.5,
          "end": 30.39,
          "en": "In order to use the useState hook,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.39,
          "end": 32.85,
          "en": "we must import useState from React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.85,
          "end": 35.25,
          "en": "of course, and then here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.25,
          "end": 38.79,
          "en": "we can register an empty string as a default state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.79,
          "end": 41.73,
          "en": "and get back this array where we, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.73,
          "end": 46.73,
          "en": "get the enteredPlayerName and the state updating function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.16,
          "end": 50.993,
          "en": "that could be called setEnteredPlayerName, and of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.74,
          "end": 55.173,
          "en": "you could also use a shorter state name here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.1,
          "end": 59.43,
          "en": "but with that added, we can then add a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.43,
          "end": 62.343,
          "en": "handleChange would be an appropriate name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.45,
          "end": 65.22,
          "en": "which we connect to this input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.22,
          "end": 68.25,
          "en": "here through the onChange prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.25,
          "end": 69.9,
          "en": "and this is, of course, nothing new,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.9,
          "end": 72.453,
          "en": "this is something we did before in the course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.31,
          "end": 77.43,
          "en": "and we'll get this event object here automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.43,
          "end": 78.263,
          "en": "As you learned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.263,
          "end": 81.75,
          "en": "React will pass it to this handleChange function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.75,
          "end": 84.15,
          "en": "when it executes this handleChange function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.15,
          "end": 86.283,
          "en": "which we're passing to the onChange prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.27,
          "end": 90.69,
          "en": "and React will execute that function for every change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.69,
          "end": 93.33,
          "en": "that happens to the value in that input field,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 93.33,
          "end": 97.88300000000001,
          "en": "so for every character we type, for example, and then here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.75999999999999,
          "end": 101.7,
          "en": "we can therefore then set the enteredPlayerName",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.7,
          "end": 104.943,
          "en": "to event.target.value, like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.89,
          "end": 110.67,
          "en": "and then we can feed that state back into the input field so",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.67,
          "end": 113.07,
          "en": "that the latest value is reflected there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.07,
          "end": 115.86,
          "en": "through the value prop, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.86,
          "end": 119.16,
          "en": "and we can set value equal to enteredPlayerName,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.16,
          "end": 123.24,
          "en": "so to our state here, and with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.24,
          "end": 127.263,
          "en": "we got a component that should store that player name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 128.64,
          "end": 132.003,
          "en": "Now, we can also add another function, handleClick,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 133.02,
          "end": 136.14,
          "en": "which should be connected to this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 136.14,
          "end": 139.053,
          "en": "through the onClick prop of course, like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 140.52,
          "end": 143.82,
          "en": "and it's in this function where we wanna take",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 143.82,
          "end": 147.12,
          "en": "that state and output it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 147.12,
          "end": 151.923,
          "en": "Therefore, we'll essentially need a second piece of state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 153.9,
          "end": 158.793,
          "en": "which we could name \"submitted,\" or something like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 160.35,
          "end": 164.76,
          "en": "and initially, that's false, and here in handleClick,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 164.76,
          "end": 169.38,
          "en": "we want to set \"submitted\" to true so that when",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 169.38,
          "end": 172.86,
          "en": "this button is clicked, we change this state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 172.86,
          "end": 176.57999999999998,
          "en": "and we can therefore now conditionally output this part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 176.57999999999998,
          "end": 180.09,
          "en": "after \"Welcome\" here by wrapping it with curly braces,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 180.09,
          "end": 184.08,
          "en": "and we can check this submitted state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 184.08,
          "end": 188.58,
          "en": "with a ternary expression, and if it's true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 188.58,
          "end": 191.46,
          "en": "I wanna output the enteredPlayerName,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 191.46,
          "end": 194.73,
          "en": "if it's false, I wanna output \"unknown entity\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 194.73,
          "end": 199.26,
          "en": "as a string, and with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 199.26,
          "end": 201,
          "en": "we should have everything we need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 201,
          "end": 203.16,
          "en": "in this component here so that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 203.16,
          "end": 208.07999999999998,
          "en": "if we save that and we go back and I enter \"Max\" here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 208.07999999999998,
          "end": 211.473,
          "en": "and click \"Set Name,\" it says, \"Welcome Max,\" here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 213.12,
          "end": 214.77,
          "en": "and initially, when we reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 214.77,
          "end": 217.05,
          "en": "it does not update with every keystroke,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 217.05,
          "end": 219.66,
          "en": "but only set this when I click here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 219.66,
          "end": 221.64,
          "en": "Thereafter though, it does update",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 221.64,
          "end": 224.01,
          "en": "with every keystroke because thereafter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 224.01,
          "end": 227.793,
          "en": "we got enteredPlayerName as a value being output here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 229.47,
          "end": 231.81,
          "en": "If we would want to prevent that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 231.81,
          "end": 234.12,
          "en": "we would have to call setSubmitted here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 234.12,
          "end": 238.8,
          "en": "in handleChange as well and set it to false here so that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 238.8,
          "end": 241.92,
          "en": "as soon as we start typing in that input field again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 241.92,
          "end": 243.93,
          "en": "this state is set back to false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 243.93,
          "end": 246.033,
          "en": "and we output \"unknown entity\" again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 247.59,
          "end": 249.57,
          "en": "So that with that, if I type \"Max\" here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 249.57,
          "end": 252.03,
          "en": "and I set this name and I continue typing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 252.03,
          "end": 255.453,
          "en": "we go back to \"unknown entity\" until I set my name again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 256.77,
          "end": 258,
          "en": "Now of course, with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 258,
          "end": 261.75,
          "en": "we always jump back to \"unknown entity\" as we type again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 261.75,
          "end": 264.723,
          "en": "and we only change that once we set the name again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 265.92,
          "end": 267.57,
          "en": "so still not ideal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 267.57,
          "end": 270.3,
          "en": "and we could work around that by adding more states",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 270.3,
          "end": 273.03,
          "en": "or computed values to save that name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 273.03,
          "end": 275.25,
          "en": "which we already set in the past,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 275.25,
          "end": 277.32,
          "en": "but as you can already tell,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 277.32,
          "end": 280.65,
          "en": "it's quite a lot of code we have to write here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 280.65,
          "end": 284.79,
          "en": "just to read the value that's entered into this input field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 284.79,
          "end": 288.093,
          "en": "at the point of time where this button here is pressed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 289.71,
          "end": 291.93,
          "en": "Because we have to manage that value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 291.93,
          "end": 295.05,
          "en": "that underlying enteredPlayerName state value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 295.05,
          "end": 298.35,
          "en": "with every keystroke, with that onChange prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 298.35,
          "end": 302.253,
          "en": "to store it and to have it available for outputting it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 303.45,
          "end": 305.97,
          "en": "and we have that second state just to know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 305.97,
          "end": 309,
          "en": "whether this button here was pressed or not,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 309,
          "end": 312.12,
          "en": "and this component here is now a great example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 312.12,
          "end": 315.453,
          "en": "for a component that can be simplified by using refs.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}